<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P ASSIGNS AAA TO KFW 40 BLN YEN BOND.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P ASSIGNS AAA TO KFW 40 BLN YEN BOND.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Tuesday it had assigned its AAA rating to Kreditanstalt fuer Wiederaufbau's (KFW) 40 billion yen three percent yen/U.S. dollar dual-currency bonds series 2 due June 4, 2001.</p>
<p>The outlook is stable, S&amp;P said.</p>
</text>
